# Language Test 202505 - DP_J: Sushi
Sonome kas N tas Kisite kas readint.
Sonome kas sushi tas Kisite kas readints vis N.
Sonome kas count1 tas 0.
Sonome kas count2 tas 0.
Sonome kas count3 tas 0.
Pilike kas x pas sushi {
    Palusta x kate 1 {
        count1 += 1.
    } Japalusta palusta x kate 2 {
        count2 += 1.
    } Japalusta {
        count3 += 1.
    }
}
Sonome kas side tas N + 1.
Sonome kas total_states tas side * side * side.
Sonome kas dp tas Kisite kas fill vis 0.0 kasta total_states.
Sonome kas c tas 0.
Sonome kas b tas 0.
Sonome kas a tas 0.
Sonome kas index tas 0.
Sonome kas nonempty tas 0.
Sonome kas value tas 0.0.
Sonome kas dep tas 0.
Pilike palusta c <= N {
    Kemese kas b tas 0.
    Pilike palusta b + c <= N {
        Kemese kas a tas 0.
        Pilike palusta a + b + c <= N {
            Kemese kas nonempty tas a + b + c.
            Palusta nonempty > 0 {
                Kemese kas value tas N.
                Palusta a > 0 {
                    Kemese kas dep tas ((a - 1) * side + b) * side + c.
                    Kemese kas value tas value + a * dp[dep].
                }
                Palusta b > 0 {
                    Kemese kas dep tas ((a + 1) * side + (b - 1)) * side + c.
                    Kemese kas value tas value + b * dp[dep].
                }
                Palusta c > 0 {
                    Kemese kas dep tas (a * side + (b + 1)) * side + (c - 1).
                    Kemese kas value tas value + c * dp[dep].
                }
                Kemese kas index tas (a * side + b) * side + c.
                Kemese kas dp[index] tas value / nonempty.
            }
            a += 1.
        }
        b += 1.
    }
    c += 1.
}
Kemese kas index tas (count1 * side + count2) * side + count3.
Takute kas dp[index].
